<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>The <b>Label</b> column is the name used by the Toolset in the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Event%20editor" title="Event editor">Event editor</a> to populate the list of available animation event types in an event's <b>ID</b> property.
</p>
